:: Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Bath Widgets [widget]
<<widget 'deadwood-reblooms-sydney-temple-shower-link'>>
  <<sydneySchedule>>
  <<if isLoveInterest('Sydney') and maplebirch.get('Sydney').available
    and _sydney_location is 'temple' and $sydney_templeWork is 'quarters'
    and !$replayScene and $SydneyExpansion.templeBathDay isnot Time.days>>
    <<bathroomicon 'shower'>><<lanLink '听听隔间里的水声' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Temple Bath Meeting'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Sirris Invitation []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'adult_shop'>><<effects>>
<<npc Sirris>><<person1>>
<<if !$adultshopclerk or C.npc.Sirris.love lte 50 or isLoveInterest('Sydney')>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Sirris is busy at the counter. You leave the question for another day.' '西里斯正忙着照看柜台。你暂时没有提起拜访的事。'>>
<<else>>
  <<set $SydneyExpansion.estate.invited to true>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Sirris sets the shop ledger aside when you ask if you might visit. "You've spent enough evenings helping here," <<he>> says. "It would be nice to talk without a queue at the counter."
      <br><br>
      <<He>> writes the address of the white gate on <span class='teal'>Danube Street</span> on a receipt. "Come by when the lights are on. The house can use company."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你问西里斯能否登门拜访。<<He>>放下店里的账簿。“你帮了这么多晚的忙，”<<he>>说，“我也想找个不用照看柜台的时候和你聊聊。”
      <br><br>
      <<He>>在收据背面写下<span class='teal'>多瑙河街</span>白色大门的地址。“屋里亮着灯时就过来吧。家里也该有客人坐坐。”
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink '返回店铺' 'Adult Shop Approach Sirris'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Temple Bath Meeting []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>>
<<sydneySchedule>>
<<if !isLoveInterest('Sydney') or _sydney_location isnot 'temple'
  or $sydney_templeWork isnot 'quarters' or $daily.sydney.punish is 1
  or ['prison', 'dungeon'].includes(C.npc.Sydney.state)>>
  <<lanSwitch 'The water has stopped. The cubicle is empty.' '水声停了。隔间里已经没人。'>>
<<else>>
  <<set $SydneyExpansion.templeBathDay to Time.days>>
  <<npc Sydney>><<person1>><<run statusCheck('Sydney')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You recognise Sydney's voice through the running water. "Someone there?" <<he>> asks from behind a closed screen. You answer before coming any closer. Sydney reaches around it for a towel, keeping the screen between you.
      <br><br>
      <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
        "I thought everyone had gone to evening prayer." <<He>> sounds relieved when <<he>> recognises you. <span class='teal'>"Could you pass me that towel?"</span>
      <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
        "You found me." Sydney laughs softly. <span class='lewd'>"I left my towel where I can't reach it."</span>
      <<else>>
        "I should have brought the towel closer," <<he>> admits. "Would you mind?"
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      水声里传来悉尼的声音。“有人吗？”<<he>>在合拢的屏风后问。你先应了一声，没有再靠近。悉尼伸手去拿毛巾，屏风仍隔在你们之间。
      <br><br>
      <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
        “我以为大家都去做晚祷了。”认出是你，<<he>>松了口气，<span class='teal'>“能帮我把毛巾递过来吗？”</span>
      <<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes('corrupt')>>
        “被你找到了。”悉尼轻轻笑了一声，<span class='lewd'>“毛巾放得太远，我够不着。”</span>
      <<else>>
        “我应该把毛巾拿近些的。”<<he>>说，“能帮帮我吗？”
      <</if>>
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink '把毛巾递给悉尼' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Temple Bath Towel'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<loveicon 'kiss'>><<lanLink '问悉尼是否想让你留下' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Temple Bath Together'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink '退回淋浴区' 'Temple Cloister Showers'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Temple Bath Towel []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>>
<<npc Sydney>><<person1>>
<<lanSwitch 'You pass the towel around the screen. Sydney takes it, and the water stops. "Thank you," <<he>> says. <<He>> waits until you have stepped back before coming out.' '你把毛巾从屏风旁递过去。悉尼接住，关上了水。“谢谢你。”<<he>>说。你退远后，<<he>>才从隔间里出来。'>>
<<npcincr Sydney love 1>><<glove>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink '返回淋浴区' 'Temple Cloister Showers'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Temple Bath Together []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>>
<<npc Sydney>><<person1>><<run statusCheck('Sydney')>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You ask if Sydney wants you to stay. The water stops. <<He>> moves the screen just enough to meet your eyes. "Only if you do," <<he>> says, and leaves you room to step away.
    <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
      <span class='teal'>"We can just wash together."</span>
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你问悉尼是否想让你留下。水声停了。<<He>>把屏风移开一点，只露出能与你对视的空隙。“你愿意的话。”<<he>>说，也给你留着退开的路。
    <<if _sydneyStatus.includes('pure')>>
      <span class='teal'>“我们也可以只一起洗澡。”</span>
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<bathroomicon 'shower'>><<lanLink '一起淋浴 (0:20)' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Temple Bath Wash'>><<strip>><<pass 20>><</lanLink>><br>
<<loveicon 'kiss'>><<lanLink '吻悉尼' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Bath Intimacy'>><<set $SydneyExpansion.bathReturn to 'temple'>><<set $sexstart to 1>><<strip>><</lanLink>><<promiscuous1>><<kissvirginitywarning>><<NPCvirginitywarning 'Sydney' 'kiss'>><br>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink '到此为止' 'Temple Cloister Showers'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Temple Bath Wash []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>>
<<npc Sydney>><<person1>><<wash>>
<<lanSwitch 'Sydney makes room beneath the warm water and hands you the soap. You wash side by side, then dry off without hurrying one another.' '悉尼在温水下为你让出位置，把肥皂递给你。你们并肩洗净身上的污垢，之后各自擦干，没有催促对方。'>>
<<stress -3>><<lstress>><<npcincr Sydney love 1>><<glove>><<clotheson>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink '返回淋浴区' 'Temple Cloister Showers'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Bathroom []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'sirris_estate'>><<effects>>
<<deadwood-reblooms-sirris-estate-presence>>
<<if !$SydneyExpansion.estate.invited or (!_sydneyAtEstate and !_sirrisAtEstate)>>
  <<lanSwitch 'The house is quiet. You leave the bathroom door closed.' '屋里很安静。你没有推开浴室门。'>>
<<else>>
  <<if $SydneyExpansion.estate.bathVisitDay isnot Time.days
    and Time.hour gte 18 and Time.hour lt 23
    and (_sydneyAtEstate or _sirrisAtEstate)>>
    <<set $SydneyExpansion.estate.bathVisitDay to Time.days>>
    <<set $SydneyExpansion.estate.bathVisitor to ''>>
    <<if _sydneyAtEstate and _sirrisAtEstate>>
      <<set $SydneyExpansion.estate.bathVisitor to (random(1, 2) is 1) ? 'Sydney' : 'Sirris'>>
    <<elseif _sydneyAtEstate>>
      <<set $SydneyExpansion.estate.bathVisitor to 'Sydney'>>
    <<elseif _sirrisAtEstate>>
      <<set $SydneyExpansion.estate.bathVisitor to 'Sirris'>>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>You stop outside the bathroom. A clean towel waits on a shelf beside the door. Warm air carries the scent of soap and the bath products from Sirris's shop.
    <<option 'CN'>>你在浴室门外停下。门边的搁板上放着干净的毛巾，暖湿的空气里有肥皂和西里斯店里洗浴用品的气味。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if $SydneyExpansion.estate.bathVisitDay is Time.days
    and $SydneyExpansion.estate.bathVisitor is 'Sydney' and _sydneyAtEstate>>
    <<npc Sydney>><<person1>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Water runs behind the closed door. Sydney calls out when <<he>> hears your steps.' '关着的门后传来水声。悉尼听见你的脚步，隔着门唤了你一声。'>><br><br>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '回应悉尼' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Sydney Bath Meeting'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<bathroomicon 'bath'>><<lanLink '等悉尼洗完再洗 (0:40)' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Bath Wash'>><<pass 40>><<strip>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<elseif $SydneyExpansion.estate.bathVisitDay is Time.days
    and $SydneyExpansion.estate.bathVisitor is 'Sirris' and _sirrisAtEstate>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Sirris is using the bath. Hearing your steps, Sirris asks who is outside the closed door.' '西里斯正在洗浴。听见你的脚步，西里斯隔着门问是谁。'>><br><br>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '隔着门回应西里斯' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Sirris Bath Meeting'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<bathroomicon 'bath'>><<lanLink '等西里斯洗完再洗 (0:40)' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Bath Wash'>><<pass 40>><<strip>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<else>>
    <<bathroomicon 'bath'>><<lanLink '独自洗浴 (0:20)' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Bath Wash'>><<pass 20>><<strip>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink '返回门厅' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Hall'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Bath Wash []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'sirris_estate'>><<effects>><<wash>>
<<set $SydneyExpansion.estate.bathVisitor to ''>>
<<lanSwitch 'You wash, dry yourself with a clean towel, and put your clothes back on.' '你洗净身体，用干净的毛巾擦干，再穿好衣服。'>><<clotheson>>
