:: Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Sydney Bath Meeting []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'sirris_estate'>><<effects>>
<<deadwood-reblooms-sirris-estate-presence>>
<<if !_sydneyAtEstate or $SydneyExpansion.estate.bathVisitDay isnot Time.days
  or $SydneyExpansion.estate.bathVisitor isnot 'Sydney'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Sydney has finished bathing and gone upstairs.' '悉尼已经洗完，上楼去了。'>>
<<else>>
  <<npc Sydney>><<person1>><<run statusCheck('Sydney')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>Sydney opens the door a little farther when <<he>> hears your voice. "I left a book on the shelf," <<he>> says, looking past you into the hall. <<He>> draws the towel around <<his>> shoulders and notices your expression.
    <<option 'CN'>>听见你的声音，悉尼才把门又开大一些。“我把书放在搁板上了。”<<he>>说着，向你身后的走廊看了一眼。<<He>>把毛巾披在肩上，留意到你的神情。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink '把书递给悉尼' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Sydney Bath Book'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<if isLoveInterest('Sydney')>>
    <<loveicon 'kiss'>><<lanLink '问悉尼能否留下' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Sydney Bath Together'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink '轻轻带上门' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Hall'>><<set $SydneyExpansion.estate.bathVisitor to ''>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Sydney Bath Book []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'sirris_estate'>><<effects>>
<<deadwood-reblooms-sirris-estate-presence>>
<<if _sydneyAtEstate and $SydneyExpansion.estate.bathVisitDay is Time.days
  and $SydneyExpansion.estate.bathVisitor is 'Sydney'>>
  <<set $SydneyExpansion.estate.bathVisitor to ''>>
  <<npc Sydney>><<person1>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You hand Sydney the book without stepping across the threshold. "I thought I had lost it," <<he>> says, smiling as <<he>> takes it.' '你站在门槛外，把书递给悉尼。“我还以为弄丢了。”<<he>>接过书，朝你笑了笑。'>>
  <<npcincr Sydney love 1>><<glove>>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'The bathroom is empty. You leave the book where it is.' '浴室里已经没人。你把书留在原处。'>>
<</if>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink '返回门厅' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Hall'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Sydney Bath Together []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'sirris_estate'>><<effects>>
<<deadwood-reblooms-sirris-estate-presence>>
<<npc Sydney>><<person1>><<run statusCheck('Sydney')>>
<<if !_sydneyAtEstate or !isLoveInterest('Sydney')
  or $SydneyExpansion.estate.bathVisitDay isnot Time.days
  or $SydneyExpansion.estate.bathVisitor isnot 'Sydney'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You have already finished here. There is nothing more to do.' '你已经收拾好了。这里没有别的事可做。'>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>You ask before stepping inside. Sydney sets the book out of reach of the water.
    <<if _sirrisAtEstate>>
      "<<nnpc_Mum 'Sirris'>> is downstairs," <<he>> says, closing the door carefully.
    <<else>>
      "It's quiet tonight," <<he>> says, and waits for your answer.
    <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>你站在门外先问了一声。悉尼把书放到水溅不到的地方。
    <<if _sirrisAtEstate>>
      “<<nnpc_Mum 'Sirris'>>在楼下。”<<he>>说，轻轻关好门。
    <<else>>
      “今晚家里很安静。”<<he>>说，等你回答。
    <</if>>
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<bathroomicon 'bath'>><<lanLink '一起洗浴 (0:20)' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Sydney Bath Wash'>><<pass 20>><<strip>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<loveicon 'kiss'>><<lanLink '吻悉尼' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sydney Bath Intimacy'>><<set $SydneyExpansion.bathReturn to 'estate'>><<set $sexstart to 1>><<strip>><</lanLink>><<promiscuous1>><<kissvirginitywarning>><<NPCvirginitywarning 'Sydney' 'kiss'>><br>
<</if>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink '到此为止' 'Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Hall'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Sirris Estate Sydney Bath Wash []
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'sirris_estate'>><<effects>>
<<set $SydneyExpansion.estate.bathVisitor to ''>>
<<npc Sydney>><<person1>><<wash>>
<<lanSwitch 'Sydney tests the water before offering you the soap. You wash together. <<He>> makes sure you have a dry towel before opening the door again.' '悉尼先试了试水温，才把肥皂递给你。你们一起洗浴。开门前，<<he>>确认你手边有干毛巾。'>>
<<npcincr Sydney love 1>><<glove>><<stress -3>><<lstress>><<clotheson>>
